The R package datasusr bundles the source of the Rust crate below (in
src/rust/vendor.tar.xz); the compiled library contains code from it. Its
authors and license, as declared by the crate:

datasus-core 0.1.0
  Authors:    André Leite
  License:    MIT
  Repository: https://github.com/StrategicProjects/datasus-rs

The module src/blast.rs of datasus-core is a Rust port of blast.c 1.3 from
zlib contrib/blast, Copyright (C) 2003, 2012, 2013 Mark Adler, distributed
under the zlib license. The license text is kept at the top of that file.
